		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28041#p28041"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>C&#039;est un problème lié à pgpPgAdmin.&#160; Pour citer le fichier de configuration phpPgAdmin :</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>// If extra login security is true, then logins via phpPgAdmin with no<br />// password or certain usernames (pgsql, postgres, root, administrator)<br />// will be denied. Only set this false once you have read the FAQ and<br />// understand how to change PostgreSQL&#039;s pg_hba.conf to enable<br />// passworded local connections.<br />$conf[&#039;extra_login_security&#039;] = true;</p></div></blockquote></div><p>Il faut donc corriger la configuration en fonction de vos besoins.</p>]]></content>
